{"5089900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Restfield: Tidy Up the Pet Cemetery", "steam_appid": 5089900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flood tore every headstone in Restfield out of the ground. All <strong>1,093</strong> of them have been recovered and are waiting by the entrance, but nobody knows where any of them stood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only records left are the photographs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sort Them By Animal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cemetery has 21 plots, one for each animal: hamsters, cats, dogs, rats, crabs, and a few more unusual residents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/e983d22137ba32f2ff70f74227f4c0cc.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/e983d22137ba32f2ff70f74227f4c0cc.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/e983d22137ba32f2ff70f74227f4c0cc.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every headstone carries an animal, a name, and a year. You can only carry a handful at a time, so filling a plot takes several trips back and forth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not Just Sorting, Deduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting the right stones to the right plot is the easy part. Each plot has six photographs showing fragments of the area from different angles. No single photo tells you the whole story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/5d3a7811be585f887abeeabd2e20c507.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/5d3a7811be585f887abeeabd2e20c507.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/5d3a7811be585f887abeeabd2e20c507.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes repeat, so a silhouette usually just narrows things down. Some photos catch a name or a year, but most don't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-reference what you see, rule out what's impossible, and work down to the one stone that fits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock An Ability With Every Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish a plot and the animals buried there leave you something behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/c686c0b0840223f8772e9a47abc449b7.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/c686c0b0840223f8772e9a47abc449b7.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/c686c0b0840223f8772e9a47abc449b7.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crab</strong> gives you a pincer, so you can hold a photo while you work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Owl</strong> reveals an extra photo for a plot you haven't solved yet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dog</strong> occasionally catches the scent of where a stone used to be.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 plots means 21 abilities, and you pick the order by choosing which plot to restore next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play It However You Like</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limits, no scores, no penalties. Just you, the quiet, and a place to restore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/9ff8f938cf68645ca9316f64524377c2.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/9ff8f938cf68645ca9316f64524377c2.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/9ff8f938cf68645ca9316f64524377c2.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer a challenge? You can turn on a speedrun timer, tweak the difficulty, or play without abilities entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Pet Could Be Here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our playtest and dedicate a headstone to your real-life pet: their name, their year, and a few words in their memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/19ee7fc2a21e697046fc9f873c3529c9.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/19ee7fc2a21e697046fc9f873c3529c9.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/19ee7fc2a21e697046fc9f873c3529c9.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1,093 headstones</strong> to return home across 21 animal plots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual deduction:</strong> Work out where each grave stood using names, dates, angles and silhouettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 partial photos per plot</strong> to cross-reference</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>21 unlockable tools</strong> that change how you inspect the cemetery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero pressure:</strong> Play at your own pace, or turn on timers and hard modes if you want to race</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flood tore every headstone in Restfield out of the ground. All <strong>1,093</strong> of them have been recovered and are waiting by the entrance, but nobody knows where any of them stood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only records left are the photographs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sort Them By Animal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cemetery has 21 plots, one for each animal: hamsters, cats, dogs, rats, crabs, and a few more unusual residents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/e983d22137ba32f2ff70f74227f4c0cc.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/e983d22137ba32f2ff70f74227f4c0cc.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/e983d22137ba32f2ff70f74227f4c0cc.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every headstone carries an animal, a name, and a year. You can only carry a handful at a time, so filling a plot takes several trips back and forth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not Just Sorting, Deduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting the right stones to the right plot is the easy part. Each plot has six photographs showing fragments of the area from different angles. No single photo tells you the whole story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/5d3a7811be585f887abeeabd2e20c507.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/5d3a7811be585f887abeeabd2e20c507.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/5d3a7811be585f887abeeabd2e20c507.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes repeat, so a silhouette usually just narrows things down. Some photos catch a name or a year, but most don't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-reference what you see, rule out what's impossible, and work down to the one stone that fits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock An Ability With Every Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish a plot and the animals buried there leave you something behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/c686c0b0840223f8772e9a47abc449b7.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/c686c0b0840223f8772e9a47abc449b7.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/c686c0b0840223f8772e9a47abc449b7.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crab</strong> gives you a pincer, so you can hold a photo while you work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Owl</strong> reveals an extra photo for a plot you haven't solved yet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dog</strong> occasionally catches the scent of where a stone used to be.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 plots means 21 abilities, and you pick the order by choosing which plot to restore next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play It However You Like</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limits, no scores, no penalties. Just you, the quiet, and a place to restore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/9ff8f938cf68645ca9316f64524377c2.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/9ff8f938cf68645ca9316f64524377c2.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/9ff8f938cf68645ca9316f64524377c2.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer a challenge? You can turn on a speedrun timer, tweak the difficulty, or play without abilities entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Pet Could Be Here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our playtest and dedicate a headstone to your real-life pet: their name, their year, and a few words in their memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/19ee7fc2a21e697046fc9f873c3529c9.poster.avif?t=1788189267\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/19ee7fc2a21e697046fc9f873c3529c9.webm?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/extras/19ee7fc2a21e697046fc9f873c3529c9.mp4?t=1788189267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1,093 headstones</strong> to return home across 21 animal plots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual deduction:</strong> Work out where each grave stood using names, dates, angles and silhouettes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 partial photos per plot</strong> to cross-reference</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>21 unlockable tools</strong> that change how you inspect the cemetery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero pressure:</strong> Play at your own pace, or turn on timers and hard modes if you want to race</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A cozy first-person sorting game in a pet cemetery. Sort 1,093 headstones by animal and cross-reference photographs to restore every grave. No timers, no penalties. Just you, the quiet, and a lot of pets somebody loved.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/bc2e66ff4d7ea5ead32ded01816e75ce983b5ca4/header.jpg?t=1788189267", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/8979d32cc6583810aa21293b869ca50cafecd217/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788189267", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5089900/8979d32cc6583810aa21293b869ca50cafecd217/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788189267", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD 